<h3>Supported keys and user actions</h3>
<p>The RadioGroup component has the same standard behavior as a regular radio buttons - navigating between them selects them immediately.</p>
<ul class="keyboard-legend">
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Down</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="button-preview button-descr">or</span>
            <span class="key-button">Right</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            Select next radio item.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Up</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="button-preview button-descr">or</span>
            <span class="key-button">Left</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            Select previous radio item.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Space</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            Selects the radio button.
        </span>
    </li>
</ul>
